{
  "_about": [
    "The Streak app's UI contract: the stable test IDs and accessibility labels that automation relies on.",
    "Framework-neutral. React Native testID = Android resource-id = iOS accessibilityIdentifier.",
    "Maestro reads this through maestro/config/test-data.js (generated by `npm run sync:test-data`).",
    "Placeholders filled at run time: {year}, {month0} (0-11, as the app's month keys use), {iso} (YYYY-MM-DD).",
    "Labels are matched as regular expressions by Maestro: escape ? . ( ) + when you mean them literally.",
    "Verified against Streak 1.0.0 (Android versionCode 4) on 2026-09-27 with `npm run inspect`."
  ],
